<title>HONG KONG: Wing On Co interim net rises 32.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Wing On Co interim net rises 32.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   47.3     vs 35.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    24.0     vs 18.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    139.99   vs 105.65</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,351.22 vs 1,259.80 (see note)</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wing On Company International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 14-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 28</p>
<p>NOTE - A department store, property holding and hotel services company.</p>
<p>Comparative turnover has been changed to HK$1.26 billion from HK$1.38 billion to conform with new Statement of Standard Accounting Practice by excluding interest income of HK$51.09 million and reporting the gain on share investments of HK$16.47 million instead of the investment amount of HK$87.46 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
